#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "BITCOIN CRASHES {move}. Burned crypto traders want something real."
msgstr "LE BITCOIN S'EFFONDRE {move}. Les traders crypto échaudés veulent du concret."

#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "BITCOIN SOARS {move}. Gold bugs sell up to chase crypto."
msgstr "LE BITCOIN S'ENVOLE {move}. Les fans d'or vendent pour courir après la crypto."

#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "Buying the dip, like my dad taught me."
msgstr "J'achète le creux, comme mon père me l'a appris."

#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "CHIP STOCKS PLUNGE: NVIDIA {move}. Tech money looks for shelter in silver."
msgstr "LES PUCES PLONGENT : NVIDIA {move}. L'argent de la tech se réfugie dans l'argent métal."

#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "DOGECOIN MOONS {move}. Lucky winners want to lock in their gains in gold."
msgstr "LE DOGECOIN DÉCOLLE {move}. Les chanceux veulent sécuriser leurs gains en or."

#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "Dog money paid off. Turning it into real money."
msgstr "L'argent du chien a payé. Je le change en vrai argent."

#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "Done with crypto. Give me something I can hold."
msgstr "Fini la crypto. Donnez-moi du concret."

#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "Forums say buy physical. How many do you have?"
msgstr "Les forums disent d'acheter du physique. Vous en avez combien ?"

#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "GOLD JUMPS {move}. Folks dig out old coins to cash in at the top."
msgstr "L'OR BONDIT {move}. On ressort les vieilles pièces pour vendre au sommet."

#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "GOLD SLIDES {move}. Panic sellers want out before it drops further."
msgstr "L'OR GLISSE {move}. Les vendeurs paniqués veulent sortir avant la chute."

#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "Gold's boring. Selling to buy tech."
msgstr "L'or, c'est ennuyeux. Je vends pour de la tech."

#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "Gold's crashing! Take them before they're worth nothing."
msgstr "L'or s'effondre ! Prenez-les avant qu'elles ne valent plus rien."

#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "Gold's up again. Time to cash in."
msgstr "L'or remonte. Il est temps d'encaisser."

#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "Heard spot is flying today. What'll you give me?"
msgstr "Il paraît que le cours s'envole. Vous m'en donnez combien ?"

#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "Lost a month's pay on chips today. Silver, please."
msgstr "J'ai perdu un mois de salaire sur les puces. De l'argent, svp."

#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "Much profit. Very gold. Wow."
msgstr "Beaucoup profit. Très or. Wow."

#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "My broker isn't picking up. You'll buy these, right?"
msgstr "Mon courtier ne répond pas. Vous les achetez, hein ?"

#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "My coins halved overnight. Gold doesn't do that, right?"
msgstr "Mes cryptos ont fondu de moitié. L'or ne fait pas ça, si ?"

#: autoload/market_events.gd
msgid "My nephew says gold is a boomer rock. Buy these?"
msgstr "Mon neveu dit que l'or, c'est un caillou de boomer. Vous les prenez ?"

