#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "%d%%. That's my floor, take it or I walk."
msgstr "%d%%. C'est mon plancher, c'est ça ou je pars."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "A gift for my granddaughter."
msgstr "Un cadeau pour ma petite-fille."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Adding to my stack."
msgstr "Pour ma pile."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Big Earl"
msgstr "Big Earl"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Bought it years ago. Time to sell."
msgstr "Acheté il y a des années. Il est temps de vendre."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Bought them online, need cash fast."
msgstr "Achetées en ligne, il me faut du liquide vite."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Bro. %d%%. I'm literally losing money here."
msgstr "Frère. %d%%. Je perds de l'argent, là."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Cleaning out the jewellery box."
msgstr "Je vide la boîte à bijoux."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Clearing out my late husband's collection."
msgstr "Je vide la collection de feu mon mari."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Come on. %d%% and we shake on it."
msgstr "Allez. %d%% et on topé là."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Comes with the card, but I lost it."
msgstr "Avec certificat, mais je l'ai perdu."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Crypto burned me. I want something real."
msgstr "La crypto m'a brûlé. Je veux du concret."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Dale"
msgstr "Dale"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Divorce. Don't ask."
msgstr "Divorce. Ne demandez pas."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Fine, fine. Ring it up."
msgstr "Bon, bon. Encaissez."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Found it at an estate sale. It's stamped."
msgstr "Trouvé dans une vente de succession. C'est poinçonné."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Found these in a drawer. Real deal, trust me."
msgstr "Trouvées dans un tiroir. Du vrai, croyez-moi."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Got it cheap from a guy. Real, I promise."
msgstr "Eues pas cher par un gars. Vraies, promis."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Grandpa Joe"
msgstr "Grandpa Joe"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Had it appraised for twice that, honest."
msgstr "On l'a estimé au double, franchement."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "How about %d%%? Meet me halfway."
msgstr "Que dites-vous de %d%% ? Coupons la poire en deux."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "I could stretch to %d%% over. Deal?"
msgstr "Je pourrais monter à %d%% au-dessus. Marché conclu ?"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "I pay well for quality, but not that well. %d%% over."
msgstr "Je paie bien la qualité, mais pas à ce point. %d%% au-dessus."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Inherited this bar. I'd rather have cash."
msgstr "J'ai hérité de ce lingot. Je préfère du liquide."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "It's been sitting in my safe deposit box."
msgstr "Il dormait dans mon coffre à la banque."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "June"
msgstr "June"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Kevin"
msgstr "Kevin"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Look, I'd take %d%% of what it's worth. That's fair."
msgstr "Écoutez, je prendrais %d%% de sa valeur. C'est honnête."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Marco"
msgstr "Marco"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Melt it down if you don't believe me."
msgstr "Faites-le fondre si vous ne me croyez pas."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "My cousin says these are worth a fortune."
msgstr "Mon cousin dit qu'elles valent une fortune."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "My uncle's a jeweller, he says it's the real thing."
msgstr "Mon oncle est bijoutier, il dit que c'est du vrai."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Need a bit of cash for the car."
msgstr "Il me faut un peu d'argent pour la voiture."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Need the money for a down payment."
msgstr "Il me faut l'argent pour un apport."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "No receipt, but they're solid. Swear."
msgstr "Pas de reçu, mais elles sont massives. Juré."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "No. I know what this is worth."
msgstr "Non. Je sais ce que ça vaut."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Okay, %d%%, but that's as low as I go."
msgstr "D'accord, %d%%, mais je ne descends pas plus."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Old Sal"
msgstr "Old Sal"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Price is up, time to cash in."
msgstr "Le cours monte, il est temps d'encaisser."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Prices dipped, I'm buying."
msgstr "Les prix ont baissé, j'achète."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Priya"
msgstr "Priya"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Quick deal? I've got another buyer waiting."
msgstr "Affaire rapide ? Un autre acheteur attend."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Quick sale. No questions, right?"
msgstr "Vente rapide. Pas de questions, hein ?"

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Selling part of my stack."
msgstr "Je vends une partie de ma pile."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Solid gold, real stone. Need cash today."
msgstr "Or massif, vraie pierre. Il me faut du liquide aujourd'hui."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
msgid "Spot plus %d%%, final offer."
msgstr "Cours plus %d%%, dernière offre."

#: scenes/shop/customer.gd
